        "Content": "Irregularly shaped parcel of land.\r\nExtending to approximately 1.35 hectares (3.34 acres)\r\nContained within folio DL86351F & DL80068F\r\nApprox. 80 meters from the town centre.\r\nOpposite new camping and motorhome park.\r\nPrevious planning permission granted for 16 residential units (now expired).\r\nSignificant residential or mixed-use development potential.\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity to acquire a substantial 1.35-hectare development site with extensive frontage onto the R257 and valuable river foreshore.The property occupies a prime position approximately 80 metres from the town centre and directly opposite a new camping and motorhome park, offering significant future potential. The lands include a vacant residence, while planning permission for 16 residential units was previously granted on the site (now expired), highlighting the development prospects of this strategically located holding. Total site area extending to approximately 1.35 hectares (3.34 acres) \r\n\r\nVacant possession."
